## 2. CORE PLATFORM MODULES

### 2.1 CLIENT RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT (CRM)

**Purpose:** Centralized client data and lifecycle management

**Key Requirements:**
- **Household Management:** Multi-generational family tracking with unlimited family tree depth
- **Client Data:** Contact, financial, family, and preference information
- **Relationship Tracking:** Client interactions, communications, and service history
- **Calendar Integration:** Outlook, Google Calendar, Microsoft Teams integration
- **Task Management:** Automated workflow tasks (birthdays, review dates, rebalancing)
- **Document Storage:** Secure vault for client documents (tax returns, statements, agreements)
- **Third-Party Integration:** Salesforce, HubSpot, Constant Contact, Calendly, Dropbox
- **Client Communication:** Email, SMS, notifications within platform
- **Alerts & Milestones:** Lifecycle event tracking and automated alerts
- **Multi-User Collaboration:** Team notes, shared contexts, access controls

**Performance Metrics:**
- Contact search: <500ms
- Household display: <2 seconds (even with 100+ family members)
- Concurrent users per firm: 500+ simultaneous

### 2.2 PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT & ACCOUNTING

**Purpose:** Comprehensive portfolio tracking, rebalancing, and tax optimization

**Core Capabilities:**
- **Multi-Custodian Support:** Native integrations with 15+ custodians (Schwab, TD, Fidelity, E*TRADE, AIM, etc.)
- **Real-Time Data Aggregation:** Sub-1-second portfolio value updates
- **Asset Class Coverage:**
  - Equities, Fixed Income, ETFs
  - Mutual Funds, Structured Products
  - Alternatives (private equity, hedge funds, real estate)
  - Commodities, Cryptocurrencies
  - Direct holdings (real estate, art, collectibles)
- **Position Tracking:** Cost basis, acquisition date, lot tracking
- **Performance Reporting:** Time-weighted return (TWR), Money-weighted return (MWR), GIPS compliance
- **Attribution Analysis:** Holdings-based attribution, security-level attribution
- **Consolidated View:** Household-level consolidated portfolio across all accounts and custodians

**Tax Features:**
- **Tax Loss Harvesting (TLH):**
  - Automated identification of harvestable positions
  - "Pick your own lots" (specific lot selection)
  - Wash sale detection and prevention
  - Harvest replacement strategies
  - Combined harvest + withdrawal execution
  - Harvest rebalancing capabilities
- **Tax-Aware Rebalancing:** Tax impact calculations before execution
- **Tax-Lot Management:** Specific identification, average cost, FIFO, LIFO
- **Tax Reporting:** Year-end tax reports, Form 8949, Schedule D integration

**Reporting & Analytics:**
- **Client Reports:** Performance, holdings, asset allocation, risk metrics
- **Advisor Dashboards:** Firm metrics, advisor production, client pipeline
- **Custom Metrics:** Sortable, filterable, exportable to PDF/PowerPoint
- **Regulatory Reports:** Compliance reports, audit trails

### 2.3 FINANCIAL PLANNING & GOALS-BASED INVESTING

**Purpose:** Integrated financial planning with investment strategy mapping

**Planning Capabilities:**
- **Goals-Based Planning:**
  - Retirement planning with multiple retirement scenarios
  - Education planning (529 plans, Coverdell accounts)
  - Wealth transfer and estate planning
  - Major life events (home purchase, wedding, career change)
  - Custom goals with flexible timelines
- **Income Projection:** Multiple income sources, CPP/OAS calculations
- **Asset Allocation Modeling:** Risk tolerance assessment, Monte Carlo analysis
- **Tax Planning:** Tax projection, tax-loss harvesting strategies, income splitting
- **Liability Management:** Debt analysis, mortgage optimization, insurance coverage
- **Estate Planning Integration:** Beneficiary analysis, asset titling recommendations
- **What-If Analysis:** Scenario modeling with real-time impact on goals

**Client Experience:**
- **Interactive Visualizations:** Goal progress tracking, retirement readiness
- **Client Portal View:** Goal status, action items, recommendations
- **Advisor Proposal Generation:** One-click proposal creation with financial plan
- **Integration with Portfolio:** Real-time portfolio data feeds into planning

**Benchmarking:**
- **Industry Data:** Investment returns, inflation assumptions, mortality tables
- **Peer Comparison:** Client portfolio vs. benchmarks and peer portfolios
- **Outcome Probability:** Goal achievement probability (Monte Carlo 10,000+ simulations)

### 2.4 TRADING & REBALANCING

**Purpose:** Efficient trade execution and portfolio rebalancing

**Trading Capabilities:**
- **Multi-Custodian Trading:** Direct trading access to 15+ custodians
- **Order Management System (OMS):**
  - Trade blotter with real-time updates
  - Order routing with best execution rules
  - Trade allocation across accounts and clients
  - Automated compliance checks before execution
- **Trade Types:** Limit orders, market orders, trailing stops, conditional orders
- **Cash Management:** Money market fund optimization, sweep settings
- **Institutional Integrations:** Direct market access (DMA) for large trades
- **Trade Review:** Pre-trade compliance, post-trade reconciliation

**Rebalancing Workflow:**
- **Model-Based Rebalancing:**
  - Create and manage portfolio models with N-tier architecture
  - Model versioning and drift detection
  - Automatic notifications when portfolios exceed drift thresholds
  - One-click rebalancing across all accounts using model
- **Tax-Efficient Rebalancing:**
  - Tax impact calculations
  - Strategic asset location optimization
  - Tax-loss harvesting integration
  - Harvest replacement logic
- **Rebalance Summary Tool:**
  - Spreadsheet-like view of proposed trades
  - Account-level notes and trade rationale
  - Historical rebalancing records
- **Reporting:** Rebalance history, execution reports, performance vs. model

### 2.5 PROPOSAL & ONBOARDING

**Purpose:** Streamlined client onboarding and investment advisory proposals

**Proposal Generation:**
- **One-Click Creation:** Generate proposals from financial plans in seconds
- **Content Library:** Pre-built proposal templates, customizable for firm branding
- **Data Integration:** Real-time financial plan data, portfolio recommendations
- **Interactive Proposals:** Client-viewable proposals with goal alignment
- **Digital Signature:** eSignature integration (DocuSign, Adobe Sign)
- **Version Control:** Track proposal changes and client feedback

**Onboarding Workflow:**
- **Account Opening:** Digital account opening flow with integrated custodian APIs
- **Document Collection:** Secure document upload and verification
- **Fund Transfer:** ACH and wire setup integrated into onboarding
- **Agreement Execution:** Digital agreement storage and tracking
- **Task Management:** Automated checklist for onboarding steps
- **Status Tracking:** Client and advisor visibility into onboarding progress

### 2.6 CLIENT PORTAL & ENGAGEMENT

**Purpose:** Self-service client experience with mobile-first design

**Portal Features:**
- **Responsive Design:** Works seamlessly on desktop, tablet, mobile
- **Real-Time Data:** Portfolio values updated throughout day
- **Goal Tracking:** Visual progress toward financial goals
- **Plan Viewing:** Interactive financial plan with scenario analysis
- **Holdings View:** Security-level holdings with allocation percentages
- **Performance Reports:** Custom date ranges, benchmark comparisons
- **Document Access:** Secure document vault for client access
- **Messaging:** Secure client-advisor communication thread
- **Alerts:** Proactive notifications for portfolio changes, market events
- **Educational Content:** Articles, webinars, market insights
- **Family Access:** Designated family members with role-based access

**Mobile Application:**
- **Native iOS & Android:** Optimized for mobile experience
- **Push Notifications:** Real-time alerts for portfolio and goal updates
- **Biometric Authentication:** Touch ID, Face ID support
- **Offline Capability:** View cached data when offline
- **Quick Actions:** One-touch access to most used features

**Engagement Analytics:**
- **Usage Metrics:** Portal login frequency, feature usage patterns
- **Engagement Scoring:** Identify disengaged clients
- **Content Recommendations:** AI-driven educational content delivery

