  - Client disclosure requirements
- **Advisor Certification:** License tracking (CFP, CFA, FSA, etc.)
- **Suitability & Best Execution:**
  - Suitability documentation automation
  - Best execution rule compliance
  - Conflict of interest tracking
  - Client approval workflows
- **Privacy & Security:**
  - GDPR compliance
  - CCPA compliance
  - SOC 2 Type II certification
  - Data privacy policies
  - Right to be forgotten
  - Data retention policies
- **AML/KYC:**
  - Know-your-client questionnaire
  - Beneficial ownership verification
  - Enhanced due diligence for high-net-worth clients
  - Ongoing monitoring for suspicious activity
- **Supervision & Review:**
  - Advisor activity monitoring
  - Trade supervision workflows
  - Regular compliance attestations
  - Compliance reporting dashboards
- **Policy & Procedure Documentation:** Template library with version control

### 2.8 BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE & ANALYTICS

**Purpose:** Data-driven insights for advisor and firm management

**Dashboards & Reporting:**
- **Advisor Performance:** Revenue by advisor, AUM trends, client count
- **Firm Metrics:** Total AUM, revenue, profitability by service line
- **Business Development:** Pipeline tracking, proposal-to-close ratios
- **Client Profitability:** Client value, service costs, profitability
- **Retention Analytics:** At-risk client identification, churn prediction
- **Operational Metrics:** Advisor utilization, task completion rates
- **Custom Analytics:** Self-service analytics with drag-and-drop interface

**Data Integration:**
- **CRM Integration:** Prospect and client data
- **Portfolio Data:** Holdings, performance, transactions
- **Financial Planning Data:** Goals, recommendations, outcomes
- **Operational Data:** Tasks, meetings, document storage

**Predictive Analytics:**
- **Client Churn Prediction:** AI model to identify at-risk clients
- **Revenue Forecasting:** Predictive firm revenue models
- **Cross-Sell Opportunities:** Identify clients for additional services

